  {
    "number": "問答 1",
    "type": "essay",
    "text": "計算 OFDM 資料傳輸率：(一)64子載波, 48載資, 間距312.5KHz, 16QAM, 1/2碼率, 1/4GI。(二)改 64QAM, 3/4碼率, 52載資, 1/8GI, 2x2 MIMO。",
    "answer": "【解答】(一)Symbol rate = 1/T_total. T_data = 1/delta_f = 3.2us. T_total = T_data*(1+1/4) = 4us. Rate = (48 * log2(16) * 1/2) / 4us = 24 Mbps。(二)Rate = (52 * log2(64) * 3/4 * 2) / (3.2 * 9/8) = 130 Mbps。"
  },
  {
    "number": "問答 2",
    "type": "essay",
    "text": "PCM 傳輸計算：(一)最小取樣率？(二)128位階時位元速率？(三)不生 ISI 之最小頻寬？",
    "answer": "【解答】(一)fs = 2B = 40 KHz。(二)Rb = fs * n = 40K * log2(128) = 280 Kbps。(三)W = Rb / 2 = 140 KHz (Nyquist BW)。"
  },
